            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>HAPPY, HEALTHY 31-YEAR-OLD</p><p>Recently found out this horse is 31 years young. He gets immune booster periodically through the year, more often than not. He has some arthritis but he is sound and happy and a good weight for an old guy.</p>",
